# symbolic SATO template
# family: F&D Private Label (label-type-code=4) / 3x4.5 / automatic (PLC), Inverted (right-hand
# engine / opposite feed direction)
# ported field-for-field from c:\Workspace\southalr\dtplb008I.i ("Is a copy of dtplb008.i but
# inverted with awk script" per its own header) -- dispatched from dtplc067.p's
# ih-label-type-code=4 branch when the line's configured include for this size is
# "dtlbl065cI.i".
#
# Same simplifications as lt04_default_3x45.sato -- see that file's header. One more thing
# reproduced verbatim: legacy source literally says "iBox Quantity:" (not "Box Quantity:") on
# this Inverted variant only -- presumably a typo introduced when the file was copied/inverted,
# left as-is rather than "corrected" since a faithful port isn't the place to silently fix
# legacy's own label text.

